      "content": "That's a great start, the vibe is definitely there. But since 'Apex' is a global campaign, we can't just stick to one couple. We need a larger group of people to show this is a worldwide standard of excellence. Can you give me a few more descriptions of different people—maybe a different gender or age—who fit that same level of ultra-high-end, elite beauty and influence? We need to capture that 'universal' luxury feel.",
